{
  "description": "T1 Mature Sycamore (Acer pseudoplatanus) - rear garden; Proposed Works: Selective pruning of branches extending across the property boundary towards, against and above the external wall and roof of 1 Rowley Mews, W14 8XR. Reduce affected branches to suitable pruning points at or before the property boundary, in accordance with BS 3998:2010 (Tree Work Recommendations). No pruning beyond the boundary is proposed. Works will be restricted to the affected sections of the canopy. No general crown reduction, tree topping or felling is proposed. All works will be undertaken from 1 Rowley Mews, using roof access where necessary, without entering the neighbouring garden. 3. Reason for Works: To provide clearance between the tree and the external wall and roof, to prevent potential damage to the building, and reduce recurring leaf accumulation within roof drainage channels, which presents a risk of blockages and associated water damage.",
